{
  "name": "Flowable Account Provisioning - Mattermost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Account Provisioning Template\n\nThe secret below already matches this tool's Provisioning Webhook Secret in the Tool Registry. Customize the \"Create Account\" node, then activate this workflow and paste its webhook URL into the Tool Registry.\n\nThe password is generated by this app and included in the request body as `password`. Use it when creating the account instead of generating your own.\n\nSee docs/provisioning/README.md in the app repo for the full request/response contract.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 340
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        32
      ],
      "id": "360950dc-b84f-4f4b-b5f6-28a03ec1cbf3",
      "name": "Read Me"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "provision-account",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -784,
        352
      ],
      "id": "ed20368d-d6f8-47b0-9a07-9d822f8f99b2",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "webhookId": "9f6a1b1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-secret-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-provisioning-key'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $env.PROVISIONING_SECRET }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -304,
        304
      ],
      "id": "b4f21dab-a81c-46db-816b-19fc0ccf3c27",
      "name": "Check Secret"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customize me\n\nReplace with a real call to the target tool's admin API to create the account. Use `{{$json.body.employeeName}}`, `{{$json.body.employeeEmail}}`, `{{$json.body.password}}`, etc.; see the README for the full payload shape. If the target tool returns its own username (not always the email), read that from the response here instead of assuming email.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 280
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d0afcf7c-a30a-4324-8230-39b7e69fc2cd",
      "name": "Customize: create the account"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "shape-username",
              "name": "username",
              "value": "={{ $('Invite Account to Mattermost').item.json.username }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        752,
        368
      ],
      "id": "9905b395-acce-45ee-88a0-cb5c6ba55a2d",
      "name": "Shape Response"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"username\": $json.username } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 201
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        912,
